		<item>
		<title>Tuvalu becomes 13th member of PCRIC, securing cyclone coverage</title>
		<link>https://insuranceasianews.com/tuvalu-becomes-13th-member-of-pcric-securing-cyclone-coverage/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Joana Nguyen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 23:55:02 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://insuranceasianews.com/?p=230594</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Work is also already underway to develop a tailored drought insurance product for Tuvalu, expected to be available in early 2027.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://insuranceasianews.com/tuvalu-becomes-13th-member-of-pcric-securing-cyclone-coverage/">Tuvalu becomes 13th member of PCRIC, securing cyclone coverage</a> appeared first on <a href="https://insuranceasianews.com">InsuranceAsia News</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="mp_wrapper">
  <div class="mepr-unauthorized-excerpt">
    <p>Tuvalu has joined the Pacific Catastrophe Risk Insurance Company (PCRIC) as its 13th member country and secured insurance coverage against cyclones, among the most significant climate-related risks fa...</p>
